Monorepo for building Third Eye World — a voice-first, blind-first social network for blind/low-vision people (nonprofit, OSS, no ads; targets loneliness not engagement). Created 2026-07-19 at github.com/Taha-Mahmoodi/third-eye-world-mono (**private**, Taha's main account).

**Build progress (2026-07-19, one very long session — 22 PRs):** governance docs + root `STATE.md` shipped. `dev`/`prod` two-branch model; every unit = feature-branch → PR → CI → merge dev → promote prod (all automated, CI green; regression #8 caught by CI → issue → fix → merge). Stack: Next 16 + React 19 + Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui (radix, RTL) + zustand; gsap + anime.js (lazy). **Shipped to prod & verified (62 tests, 0 axe light+dark via /browse, green CI):** Slice 0 (record → gapless radio → 3-route controls, IndexedDB, PWA); Slice 1 (1a transcripts/1b channels/1c shuffle + search); Slice 3 backend `services/api` (Hono + **node:sqlite** + fs; memos/timeline/search/likes/comments/reports; stub ASR w/ one-file-swap interface; CI Node pinned 26 for node:sqlite); Slice 2 (2a moderation backend: queue/decisions/appeals-to-different-reviewer/transparency; 2b accessible moderator console = first web↔API integration). Slice **6a** = DM franking construction shipped but **⚠️ UNAUDITED reference, functional tests only, must be replaced by libsignal** — NOT in the verified set. **More shipped after re-checking "impossible" (2026-07-19/20, key insight: GPU=throughput-not-capability; native/server LOGIC testable w/o simulator via `swift run` / HTTP):** magic-link auth (real, tested; only email provider deferred); **real ASR = whisper.cpp on CPU** (ffmpeg convert, env-gated, verified say→webm→whisper); **text-memo TTS** (say dev / Piper prod); **iOS `ThirdEyeCore`** Swift RadioEngine port (`swift run` 19-check, macOS CI job — Swift 6.3 present, but XCTest/swift-testing need Xcode so use assert-based executable); **IVR TwiML** call flow (tested over HTTP). CI: node pinned 26; api whisper/tts tests skipIf(no-binary/non-darwin); apps/ios has no package.json so turbo ignores it. whisper.cpp+model live in ~/whisper-tools (outside repo). **Still needs external accounts/toolchains (never faked):** native iOS/Android UI (Xcode / Android JDK+SDK — brew JDK install timed out), GPU (Whisper